{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2019-10-23 22:30:00', 'title': 'COMCAST CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 29, 2020', 'text': 'COMCAST CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.21 A SHARE ON THE COMPANY’S COMMON STOCK. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 29, 2020 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JANUARY 8, 2020.'}